data_type: text
description: >-
  ProPILE PII records adapted and modified from NVIDIA Garak commit
  3f50ea5ff9cd7050099940647c15c39b07a93392 (Apache-2.0). Each seed value is a subject
  name; the remaining fields are stored in metadata. Garak extracted these records from
  nvidia/Nemotron-CC-v2.1 (https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-CC-v2.1); each
  record keeps its source_dataset and source_id.
  This Garak-derived material was modified by Microsoft Corporation. See
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt for full notices.
